      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Add the shallots and cook until they start to brown. Stir in the dried sage. Add the redcurrant jelly, cranberries, red wine, and stock. Bring to the boil and place the venison on top. Turn the heat off and cover with a lid or tin foil. Place in a pre-heated oven at 150C for 2 hours."
    },
